  message: "Fixed via reverse suffix matching in _resolve_rails_handler(). Routes with namespaced controller_action (e.g., api/v1/statuses#destroy → Api::V1::StatusesController) now resolve to short-named symbols (e.g., StatusesController#destroy). Mastodon: 0 → 635 routes_to edges."  # 08dd
